(text "J70 uses a 36-contact socket aligned with Pi GPIO pins 3-38.\nPin 2 is supplied through Pi pin 4; pins 1/39/40 are outside this socket.\nPower and ground connect to the PCB; other used pins carry 3.3 V SPI/GPIO.\nThe Pi has no external USB accessories in the design load case." (at 304.8 194.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "66120909-151e-44e1-b8cc-255010983311"))
(text "CAN termination is at the front and rear zones only.\nRemove both isolation shunts to disconnect one local transceiver." (at 20.32 318.77 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7e3af548-dbd0-44f6-954c-5fa8a940df3d"))
